From 60701d1eac9c808ccf28575c1300d2e2fcccb20a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:21:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 15/34] Map preview after a pause in the clicks; generator
 phase clock

Every click on the map size, the mission or the game type made a whole
new map for the preview: seconds for a large map on a 68060, and
clicking through the sizes made one map after another. The clicks now
ask for a preview, made 0.4 s after the last one; until then the preview
area says 'Making the map'. Loading shows the save's map, no new one.

remove_islands expands from a list instead of scanning the whole map
until nothing changes (the same result). mapgen_ms/mapgen_phase time the
phases of generate() for a test program.
---
 src/game-init.cc     |  39 +++++++++++---
 src/game-init.h      |   7 +++
 src/map-generator.cc | 121 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 3 files changed, 108 insertions(+), 59 deletions(-)

